---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Glitched Network privacy policy.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Glitched Network only uses basic information needed to run the website, Discord community, and Minecraft server.</p>

            <h2 class="font-PressStart2P">Information</h2>
            <p>The server may process Minecraft usernames, Discord usernames, chat messages, moderation records, IP/server connection logs, and any information you send through community channels.</p>

            <h2 class="font-PressStart2P">Use</h2>
            <p>This information is used for moderation, server security, support, appeals, and keeping the community working properly.</p>

            <h2 class="font-PressStart2P">Third Parties</h2>
            <p>Discord, Minecraft, Microsoft, Mojang, hosting providers, and any store or analytics services may have their own privacy practices.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
